cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Awesome Text Effect Prompts"
message: "If you use these prompts or this data, please cite it and link https://fontvibe.ai/styles."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "FontVibe"
    website: "https://fontvibe.ai"
abstract: >-
  Copy-paste prompts for AI text effects (neon, chrome, liquid glass, ink
  brush, pixel art, pop art and more), each with a {{TEXT}} placeholder,
  derived from FontVibe's style library, screened for trademarks, rewritten to
  work without FontVibe's font pipeline, and tested on a general image model
  before inclusion. Style names and descriptions in English, Japanese,
  Chinese, Spanish, Portuguese and German.
keywords:
  - prompts
  - text effects
  - typography
  - lettering
  - text-to-image
  - image generation
  - prompt engineering
  - multilingual
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://fontvibe.ai/styles"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Funovate-Technology/awesome-text-effect-prompts"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23776182"
